            "On \"and\", brush the ball of the right foot forward along the floor.",
            "On the beat, brush it back as the left leg gives a small hop.",
            "Change weight and repeat with the left foot.",
            "Try it travelling backwards by taking a small step back after each brush."
          ],
          "tips": [
            "Keep the brush on the floor — the sound of the ball of the foot is part of the step.",
            "The hop is tiny. If you are jumping, it will fall behind the music."
